Output docs/demo/check-updates.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 900
Set Height 620
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 80ms

Hide
Type "source docs/demo/env.sh && clear"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Show

Sleep 1s
Type "check-updates"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 3s
Type "y"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 4s
Type "n"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 3s
